Race/with-a-bit-of-menthol.html","line":86},{"title":"Prov.18:17","target":"https://www.esv.org/verses/Prov.18%3A17/","line":94}],"metadata":{"title":"Doug Wilson's Views on Race, Racism, Slavery and the Bible","source":"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/blogs/thabiti-anyabwile/doug-wilsons-views-on-race-racism-slavery-and-the-bible/","author":["[[Thabiti Anyabwile]]"],"published":"2013-03-12","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Yesterday I expressed my intention to engage Doug Wilson’s views on race, racism, slavery and the Bible as expressed in his book, Black and Tan. I think the first responsibility of charitable engagement is to attempt understanding the other person’s point-of-view and to accurately relate it to others. Without that step, there can be no real exchange. So, here is my attempt at setting forth Wilson’s positions on these subjects, quoting heavily from Wilson himself. Wilson on Racism The first thing to state, because it has often been denied, is that Wilson categorically denounces racism. The book is replete with..."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:2013-03-12 - Doug Wilson's Views on Race, Racism, Slavery and the Bible.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1uffade","at":1785795007324},"key":"2013-03-12 - Doug Wilson's Views on Race, Racism, Slavery and the Bible.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,9],"size":914,"outlinks":[{"title":"Thabiti Anyabwile","target":"Thabiti Anyabwile","line":5}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
